From cf01e5c43eee3fc99b3200b8b967f0fa36a911b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 19:37:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mask): slide the wearable out at frame edges so no lip
 sliver is exposed

When a face leaves or enters through a frame edge, landmarks are lost a few frames before
the lips are fully off screen. Continue the last wearable along the lips' own motion for at
most half a second, only when the lips were already at the edge, never across a cut and
never deeper into the frame. Lips entirely outside the frame no longer count as uncovered.

